silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_03_quality_leg_concrete_anchor#bodymassquality silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassQuality is BodyMassQuality: the quality attribute of having a body mass; a BFO/PATO quality type (PATO:0000128) that inheres in Mittens; distinct from the numeric value 3450 and the measurement event WeightMeas_3450g." .
