silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_03_quality_leg_concrete_anchor#qualityarrow_bodymass silm:hasLongDescription "The QualityArrow_BodyMass is QualityArrow_BodyMass: the typed arrow BodyMassQuality -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from measurement_leg (WeightMeas_3450g -> MittensColimitApex). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'quality_leg', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
