silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_03_quality_leg_concrete_anchor#pato_0000128 silm:hasLongDescription "The PATO_0000128 is PATO_0000128: the Phenotype And Trait Ontology (PATO) term for mass quality; the ontological authority that classifies BodyMassQuality as a mass-type quality attribute. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'QualityTypeAuthority', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
